{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 76,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0228576660156,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "a dry ear on follow-up. Bacteriological improvement was defined as failure to isolate",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        248.08294677734375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "organisms on post-treatment middle-ear swab.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.1713562011719,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "A total of 135 patients (152 ears) aged 2–84 years were enrolled: 77 ears were treated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0427551269531,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "with gentamicin and 75 with gentamicin-betamethasone. Only 70% of patients in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1228332519531,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "both groups were followed-up, but attrition was similar in both groups. Bacteria were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.1329650878906,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "isolated from 83% of pre-treatment middle-ear swabs. The most common organisms",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.61207580566406,
        340.78765869140625,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Pseudomonas aeruginosa Staphylococcal aureus were   (34%) and   (17%).",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.0614318847656,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Comparing the gentamicin and the gentamicin-betamethasone groups, there was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.14288330078125,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "no statistical difference in clinical improvement (87.7% versus 86.5%, p > 0.05) nor",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.08282470703125,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "bacteriological improvement (82.5% versus 75%, p > 0.05). Bone and air conduction",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.0528869628906,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "were not statistically different between groups, and no complications attributable to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        155.90292358398438,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "the treatment regimens.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        224.23611450195312,
        329.35919189453125,
        236.37611389160156
      ],
      "text": "Effect of topical steroid in acute otitis media with otorrhoea through",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        237.23611450195312,
        142.7829132080078,
        249.37611389160156
      ],
      "text": "a tympanostomy tube",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        250.24610900878906,
        399.08282470703125,
        263.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Roland (2003) was a multicentre trial that compared the effectiveness of ciprofloxacin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        263.24609375,
        399.0729064941406,
        276.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "0.3%/dexamethasone 0.1% with ciprofloxacin 0.3% in resolving acute tympanostomy",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        276.24609375,
        399.0927734375,
        289.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "tube otorrhoea. Children aged 6 months to 2 years with acute otitis media (AOM)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        289.24609375,
        399.0928649902344,
        302.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "with tympanostomy tubes (AOMT) of less than or equal to 3 weeks’ duration and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        302.24609375,
        399.0829162597656,
        315.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "visible otorrhoea were randomized to either group. Clinical signs and symptoms of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.24609375,
        396.84283447265625,
        328.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "AOMT were evaluated on days 1 (baseline), 3, 8 (end-of-therapy), and 14 (test-of-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.24609375,
        380.5528259277344,
        341.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "cure), and twice-daily assessments of otorrhoea were recorded in patient diaries.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        341.24609375,
        399.0415954589844,
        354.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "One hundred and sixty-seven (167) children had a positive culture. For these",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.24609375,
        399.0628967285156,
        367.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "children, the mean time to cessation of otorrhoea were significantly shorter (4.22 versus",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.24609375,
        399.14300537109375,
        380.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "5.31 days; p = .004). The clinical responses on days 3 and 8 were significantly better (p <",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.24609375,
        399.0828552246094,
        393.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": ".0001 and p = .0499, respectively) with topical ciprofloxacin/dexamethasone than with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.24609375,
        399.0528259277344,
        406.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "ciprofloxacin alone. There were no significant differences between the two treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.24609375,
        373.1929016113281,
        419.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "groups in either the clinical response or the microbial eradication rate by day 14.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.7400207519531,
        126.80288696289062,
        439.8800048828125
      ],
      "text": "Indirect evidence",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.75,
        399.05279541015625,
        454.2400207519531
      ],
      "text": "A number of in-vitro studies have suggested a protective role of topical steroids on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        453.75,
        399.08306884765625,
        467.2400207519531
      ],
      "text": "reducing the toxicity of topical antibiotics. Park (2004) demonstrated in-vitro that the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        466.75,
        399.1130065917969,
        480.2400207519531
      ],
      "text": "toxicity of gentamicin to rodent-isolated outer cochlear cells was reduced with the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        479.75,
        399.12286376953125,
        493.2400207519531
      ],
      "text": "addition of dexamethasone. Himeno (2002) showed that intra-cochlear administration",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        492.75,
        345.4929504394531,
        506.2400207519531
      ],
      "text": "of dexamethasone attenuated aminoglycoside toxicity in the guinea pig.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        517.2686157226562,
        163.96287536621094,
        529.2586669921875
      ],
      "text": "8.5.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        532.9232177734375,
        399.0029296875,
        546.4132080078125
      ],
      "text": "No data on benefits or risks of using topical steroids are available. The addition of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        545.9232177734375,
        399.052734375,
        559.4132080078125
      ],
      "text": "steroids to other topical medications did not seem to provide any additional benefit.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        558.9232177734375,
        399.0227355957031,
        572.4132080078125
      ],
      "text": "There is a possible risk of exaggerating fungal overgrowth that is reported when using",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        571.9232177734375,
        131.35292053222656,
        585.4132080078125
      ],
      "text": "topical antibiotics.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        596.44189453125,
        205.30300903320312,
        608.4319458007812
      ],
      "text": "8.5.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        612.0963745117188,
        344.9429016113281,
        625.5863647460938
      ],
      "text": "This has no additional value and use will increase the cost of treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.40969848632812,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6356964111328,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "62",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}